  "ruleText": "Per 102.68 “Pay band” means a range of pay established for a group of job titles. The term includes “labor grade” and “salary grade.”\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.59), eff 12-1-25",
